   `Token` and `Span` objects are views of this array.

   `spacy.blank('en')` returns a `spacy.tokens.doc.Doc` object.

    In the context of spacy, a token is a word, punctuation symbol, whitespace (?) etc.

   `Doc.ents` returns the named *entities* in the document.

